      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SO GLAMOROUS (6) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (28.79) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. AUNTIE AMBER (8) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at Shepparton over 650m behind Power Squeeze (38.64) in a Special conditions race. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. ATOMIC DIVA (7) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (25.06) in a Grade 5 at this track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Cannot be taken lightly. SUPER MAX (1) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
